= extend('layout')

.hero.main.centered
  .container
    h2 Flatiron + Nitrous
    h4.subtitle Learn how the Flatiron School in NYC is using Nitrous

.hero.featurette.video
  .container
    .row
      .col-xs-12.col-md-9.col-md-offset-2
        .embed-responsive.embed-responsive-16by9
          iframe.img-responsive src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/134506627" width="800" height="450" frameborder="0" webkitallowfullscreen mozallowfullscreen allowfullscreen

article.blockquote.flatiron
  .container
    .row
      .col-xs-12.col-md-8.col-md-offset-2
        blockquote
          p
            . Flatiron uses Nitrous as the cloud-coding platform in its Pre-College Academy courses, designed to start students on a path to becoming professional software developers.
            span.highlight Nitrous removes administrative and IT burdens,
            | so that teachers and instructors can focus on providing the best quality of education and meeting specific students' needs

          p
            . The key to Flatiron's selection of Nitrous is the
            span.highlight collaboration features
            | that allow instructors and students to work Google-docs style on the same code in real-time. Using Nitrous, students can request coaching from both the local instructor and other Flatiron instructors who are remote, solving problems together and amongst the class using pair-programming techniques.

        a.btn.btn-default.caps
          | Register Interest